Not part of the standard contract build/test loop.

`scripts/dev.sh` skips packages carrying this marker (ls_contract_packages),
which is what keeps this package out of `eg_test_all`. It is built only by
scripts/bigint-bench.sh, once per (backend, operation) pair, and only for rv32:

    scripts/dev.sh bigint-bench          # full rv32 codesize + gas sweep
    scripts/dev.sh bigint-bench-test     # host differential test only

The package name deliberately lacks the `-rv32` suffix so the standard rv32
wrapper glob (and scripts/metrics/sdk_codesizes_rv32.sh, which derives its
append-only metric rows from that same glob) does not pick up 34 build variants
of it.
